                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The period of one's life when one attends school, particularly, primary school (as opposed to college days); one's youth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edcae17f-513c-433b-a398-764033787095",
                                                "sense_id": "ed6a2fde-398d-3143-8b55-a9146abc9d1d",
                                                "text": "I can hardly remember my schooldays now that I have reached middle age."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14f7af29-aa70-4d88-a99a-92c993888175",
                                                "sense_id": "ed6a2fde-398d-3143-8b55-a9146abc9d1d",
                                                "text": "Baſſ. In my ſchoole dayes, when I had loſt one ſhaft\nI ſhot his fellow of the ſelfeſame flight\nThe ſelfeſame way, with more aduiſed watch\nTo finde the other forth, and by aduenturing both,\nI oft found both. I vrge this child-hoode proofe, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
